{"t":"HD","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"The Home Depot, Inc.","ko":"홈디포","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Home Improvement Retail","employees":470000,"hq":"Atlanta, GA, United States","website":"https://www.homedepot.com","summary_en":"The Home Depot, Inc. operates as a home improvement retailer in the United States and internationally. It sells various building materials, home improvement products, lawn and garden products, and décor products, as well as facilities maintenance, repair, and operations products. The company also offers installation services for flooring, water heaters, baths, garage doors, cabinets, cabinet makeovers, countertops, sheds, furnaces and central air systems, windows, and window coverings. In addition, it provides tool and equipment rental services. The company serves consumers, such as do-it-yourself homeowners and do-it-for-me customers; and professional renovators/remodelers, general contractors, homebuilders, maintenance professionals, handymen, property managers, building service contractors and specialty tradespeople, such as electricians, landscapers, insulation installers, plumbers, painters, pool contractors, roofers, and wallboard and ceiling installers. It sells its products through websites and its mobile applications, including homedepot.com; homedepot.ca and homedepot.com.mx; blinds.com, justblinds.com, and americanblinds.com for custom window coverings; constructionresourcesusa.com or design-oriented surfaces, appliances, and architectural specialty products; thecompanystore.com, an online site for textiles and décor products; hdsupply.com for maintenance, repair, and operations products and related services; and srsdistribution.com, heritagelandscapesupplygroup.com, heritagepoolsupplygroup.com, and gms.com for roofing and building materials, landscape, and pool products; and The Home Depot stores. The Home Depot, Inc. was incorporated in 1978 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Home Depot, Inc.는 미국 및 해외에서 주택 개조 소매업체로 운영되고 있습니다. 다양한 건축 자재, 주택 개조 제품, 잔디 및 정원 제품, 장식 제품은 물론 시설 유지 관리, 수리 및 운영 제품을 판매합니다. 이 회사는 또한 바닥재, 온수기, 욕조, 차고 문, 캐비닛, 캐비닛 개조, 조리대, 창고, 화로 및 중앙 공기 시스템, 창문 및 창 덮개에 대한 설치 서비스도 제공합니다. 또한 도구 및 장비 대여 서비스도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 DIY 주택 소유자 및 DIY 고객과 같은 소비자에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 전문 개조업체/리모델러, 일반 도급업자, 주택 건설업자, 유지 관리 전문가, 잡역부, 부동산 관리자, 건축 서비스 도급업자 및 전문 기술자(예: 전기기사, 조경사, 단열재 설치업자, 배관공, 화가, 수영장 도급업자, 지붕업자, 벽판 및 천장 설치업자). homedepot.com을 포함한 웹사이트와 모바일 애플리케이션을 통해 제품을 판매합니다. homedepot.ca 및 homedepot.com.mx; 맞춤형 창문 덮개를 위한 blinds.com, justblinds.com 및 americanblinds.com; constructionresourcesusa.com 또는 디자인 지향 표면, 가전제품 및 건축 전문 제품; 직물 및 장식 제품을 위한 온라인 사이트인 thecompanystore.com; 유지 관리, 수리, 운영 제품 및 관련 서비스에 대한 hdsupply.com 지붕 및 건축 자재, 조경 및 수영장 제품에 대한 srsdistribution.com, Heritagelandscapesupplygroup.com, Heritagepoolsupplygroup.com 및 gms.com; 그리고 홈디포(Home Depot) 매장. Home Depot, Inc.는 1978년에 설립되었으며 조지아주 애틀랜타에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":349.94,"mcap":349131505664.0,"pe":24.871359,"fpe":21.91342,"peg":1.8742,"ps":2.0637176,"pb":21.017418,"ev_ebitda":16.644,"div":2.66,"beta":0.947,"hi52":397.63,"lo52":277.15},"fin":{"rev":169176006656.0,"rev_g":0.057,"eps_g":0.046,"gross":0.32801,"op":0.12858,"net":0.0841,"roe":1.0429599,"fcf":10762625024.0,"cash":2084999936.0,"debt":63188000768.0,"de":380.261,"eps":14.07,"feps":15.96921},"own":{"short":0.0136,"inst":0.76723,"insider":0.00075},"analyst":{"n":32,"mean":379.0,"median":392.5,"high":425.0,"low":310.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.88889,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":18,"hold":14,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":17,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":17,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-26","Firm":"Stifel","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":322.0,"priorPriceTarget":346.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-09","Firm":"Bernstein",